tpm 1
boot power
# title-early: power-on with blank cards; SW_ON and TIT_DEMO's whole story without input. Start at
# TITLE's tick 2 (the first tick a movie can press) is seen at tick 3, phase 1's first step, just
# after phase 0 requested the title music: the skip to "press start". Start at tick 200 exits to
# SELECT (5 ticks).
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
2 1 START
200 1 START
program SELECT
end 5
